  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Can We Have A Mutual Friends Tab Please, I Think People Would Really Much Enjoy That So They Wont Be Confused When Meeting Someone,\n\nFor Example lets Say I Know Someone Joined Me By The Name Of Tim And Tim Don't Remember Me At All But Lets Say We Both Know Someone By The Name Of John But If I Know That We Both Know The Person Named John Because Of The Mutual Friends Tab Then Me And That Person Will Feel More Comfy Being Around Each Other And Then We Can Chat More And More And See If The Memories Come Back",
